 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Maryoku ga nai to Kandousaremashita ga, Oukyuu de Seijou Hajimemasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "魔力がないと勘当されましたが、王宮で聖女はじめます"
   },
   {
    "en": "I was Banished for Having No Magic... but Now I'll Begin My Work as a Saint in the Royal Palace"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yuno was the eldest daughter of a prestigious family of sorcerers, but despite her noble blood, she possessed no magical power. Because of that, her family cast her aside and threw her out of their home. With nowhere else to go, she found work as a maid in the royal palace. But fate wasn't entirely cruel... The man she was assigned to serve turned out to be none other than Dirk — the kingdom's prince, and her very first love, the one man who once made her feel seen and safe. However, Dirk is no longer the same. He's distant, cold, and unable to speak his true feelings.\n\nThus begins a story of silent affection between two hearts that long for one another but can't bring themselves to speak... Will they be able to break down the walls of pride and silence — and find their way to a happy ending?",
   "ja": "捨てられた令嬢と素直になれない王子が贈る、両片思いシンデレラロマンス。魔法使いの名門の長女でありながら、魔法が使えないため、実家を勘当され、王宮で侍女として働くことになったユノ。お仕えするご主人様は、かつての唯一の支えだった初恋の相手、ディルクで――!?"
  },
